{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"daemons"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/DaemonID","text":"DaemonID","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GnustoEngine8DaemonIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/Daemon","text":"Daemon","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GnustoEngine6DaemonV"},{"kind":"text","text":"] { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Daemons are classic ZIL features used to implement recurring game world events,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"NPC behaviors, or other processes that occur automatically without direct player"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"command. For example, a daemon might make an NPC wander, cause a light source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to gradually dim, or check if a certain game condition triggers a special event."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameEngine"},{"type":"text","text":" uses these definitions to manage active daemons throughout the game."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The key is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DaemonID"},{"type":"text","text":" and the value is the corresponding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Daemon"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default implementation provides an empty dictionary.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/d